                  "settings": {
                    "editor": "<p>So we built something different. H2H Dating — Heart to Heart — is America's only 100% free, AI-free, human-verified dating platform. Every profile is reviewed by a real person. Every feature is available at zero cost. No paywalls. No algorithms deciding your fate. Just real people, genuinely connecting.</p>",
